\f1\b \cf2 \strokec2 Importance:
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\li793\fi-423\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 	In high-power portable tools, safety is paramount. Drive control must achieve a critical balance between delivering high performance (torque/speed) and providing instantaneous, robust protection against faults like jamming that can cause severe user injury (kickback). Furthermore, thermal management is mandatory to prevent insulation failure and motor burnout, directly determining the product's lifespan.\
