\f1\b \cf2 \strokec2 Market Relevance:
\f0\b0 \
\pard\tx318\pardeftab720\li757\fi-758\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 		This is an essential control strategy used across the entire power tool sector (drills, saws, grinders, etc.), especially in professional-grade equipment. The logic for instantaneous torque cutout during a stall is a competitive safety feature, while reliable thermal derating is standard practice required to meet industry standards for continuous operation and warranty limits.
